sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    participant Channel as SVC-017<br/>Digital Channels
    participant Retail as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core

    Note over Customer,Retail: EX-001 — ISA Allowance Exceeded

    Customer->>Channel: Request deposit of £6,000 to Cash ISA (subscription_used already £15,000)
    Channel->>Retail: POST /savings/accounts/{id}/deposits {amount: "6000.00"}
    Note right of Retail: Validate: 15000 + 6000 = 21000 > 20000 (annual allowance)<br/>Reject deposit
    Retail-->>Channel: 409 Conflict {error_code: ISA_ALLOWANCE_EXCEEDED, remaining_allowance: "5000.00"}
    Channel-->>Customer: "You can deposit up to £5,000 more to your Cash ISA this tax year. New tax year starts 6 April."
